{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00324","headline":"渡中江望石城泣下 · 後主煜","name":"渡中江望石城泣下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南江北旧家乡，三十年来梦一场。\n吴苑宫闱今冷落，广陵台殿已荒凉。\n云笼远岫愁千片，雨打归舟泪万行。\n兄弟四人三百口，不堪闲坐细思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}